        <head>Perfect in Paduate</head>
        <p>Perfect in Paduate</p>
        <p>_ The Rev. Grange Bennett attended the Pad- gate Devotional Wesley Guild Meeting last night, and took for his subject "Is it possible perfect in Padgate?" to be Sliating Accident at Aeker's Pits. During tne brief frost this week a large num- ber of skaters went to Longford and Acker's Pits. At the latter place on New Year's morn- ing several people fell in the water, but got out none the worse fer the ducking.</p>
