        <p>Mrs. J. Shepherd (Bacup), Mrs. Bate, "Sallie and Ada" (Tarporley), Mr. E. Browne, "Belle and " Edith and Mabel" (Twicken- ham), Mr. A. Jr. Crosfield, Mr. and Mrs. War- wick Brookes (London), Mrs. Walter Brough and family, Mr. J. Richardson, Mr. and Mrs. Mainwaring and family, Mr. and Mrs. W. Gill, Mrs. Peter Leigh and family, Mr. and Mrs. George Dean and family (Whitley), the War- rington Liberal Association, L. Burdett, "Emily and Rupert," Mr. and Mrs. W. S. Howard (Fearnhead), Mrs. Alfred Silcock, Mr. and Mrs. Atkinson, Mr. Oliver Wheeler, "From his fellow passengers—Padgate," Mr. and Mrs. Greenhouse, Mr. and Mrs. Ker. Mr. T. Sudlow and family. Mr. and Mrs. J. Gandy and May. Mr. and Mrs. Joseph Mason (-Fearnhead), "Eric," Mr. and Mrs. James Mason and family. Mr. and Mrs. W. Webb (Fearnhead). Mrs.- Had- dock and Rosie (" Sunnyside," Fearnhead), Mrs. and M. Burdett, Mrs. William Richard- son and family. Mr. and Mrs. Thomas Bate. and Mr. and Mrs. Henry Roberts. - -</p>
