        <head>X 5 6</head>
        <p>X 5 6</p>
        <p>0* 6)</p>
        <p>MEANING OF TIIE SIGNS. • "Go in this direction, the other road not</p>
        <p>good." 2. "Too poor to give anything." 3. "Stop; if you are selling what they happen to want, they'll buy.,, 4. "Spoiled; too many vagrants can." 5. " Good ; safe for something if you don't talk much." "Religious, but kind." Z. "Dangerous ; likely to be given in charge." 8. "Mind the dog.; may give you in charge:" 9. Cross-sticks put by gipsies and tramps at the junetiOn of ,roads to show in which directionr, their friends have gone before them—the long line, pointing the way.</p>
