      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1914-01-03_WidnesExaminer_art0124" n="art0124">
        <head>YeAl LES,</head>
        <p>YeAl LES,</p>
        <p>WOMEN'S_ QUESTIONS.</p>
        <p>The Ornaments which Increase the Beauty of the Wearer.</p>
        <p>34,36,38,40,42.44.46,48. fOgifqii-R1?, /2/4T.ROYM 'ORRIS: FINN/51//114WYM001. LIVERPOOL</p>
