        <p>BOYDELL BROTHERS' Annual Tailoring Sale Nothing Altered Except the Price—and That's Reduced. During the whole of the month of January we will allow our Customers a discount of 3s in the £ on any order. And that is the only alteration we make for this Sale. II The same cloths marked at the same figures, on which we have founded our big trade extension last year, can still be seen—the same cutters, whose skill and experience have drawn so many well-groomed men to our establishment, will still be at your service—and the same tailors who are regularly employed on our garments will still build up the cloths chosen by our January patrons. THROUGHOUT THE WHOLE OF JANUARY ONLY. BOYDELL BROTHERS, THE HOME OF FINE TAILORING, 43, BRIDGt STREET, WARRINGTON.</p>
